fset":1137}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"authority","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":60,"offset":1137},"end":{"line":38,"column":71,"offset":1148}}},{"type":"text","value":" 欄位中傳入 ","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":71,"offset":1148},"end":{"line":38,"column":78,"offset":1155}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"PermanentDelegate","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":78,"offset":1155},"end":{"line":38,"column":97,"offset":1174}}},{"type":"text","value":" 權限。","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":97,"offset":1174},"end":{"line":38,"column":101,"offset":1178}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1,"offset":1078},"end":{"line":38,"column":101,"offset":1178}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":38,"column":101,"offset":1178}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# 永久代理擴展\r\n\r\n`PermanentDelegate` 擴展是一個鑄幣賬戶擴展，允許為該鑄幣的所有代幣設置一個永久代理，該代理能夠從任何代幣賬戶轉移或銷毀該鑄幣的任何代幣。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"初始化鑄幣賬戶\" id=\"initializing-the-mint-account\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n要在 `Mint` 賬戶上初始化 `PermanentDelegate` 擴展，我們可以簡單地使用 `Anchor` 為我們創建的宏。\r\n\r\n以下是如何使用永久代理擴展創建鑄幣的方法：\r\n\r\n```rust\r\n#[derive(Accounts)]\r\npub struct CreateMint<'info> {\r\n    #[account(mut)]\r\n    pub signer: Signer<'info>,\r\n    #[account(\r\n        init,\r\n        payer = signer,\r\n        mint::decimals = 6,\r\n        mint::authority = signer.key(),\r\n        mint::token_program = token_program\r\n        extensions::permanent_delegate::delegate = signer,\r\n    )]\r\n    pub mint: InterfaceAccount<'info, Mint>,\r\n    pub system_program: Program<'info, System>,\r\n    pub token_program: Interface<'info, TokenInterface>,\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"授權操作\" id=\"permissioned-actions\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n與可以被撤銷的普通代理不同，該代理權限是永久且不可更改的。\r\n\r\n這意味著每個普通操作，例如 `transfer()`、`burn()`、`approve()` 和 `freeze()`，都可以在需要時直接由代理權限執行，而無需實際擁有者的簽名。\r\n\r\n這意味著我們可以直接使用普通的 `transferChecked()`、`burnChecked()` 等指令，並在 `authority` 欄位中傳入 `PermanentDelegate` 權限。","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"rust","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"#[derive("}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#97E1F1;font-style:italic"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Accounts"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":")]"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"pub"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" struct"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#97E1F1;font-style:italic"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" CreateMint"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"<'"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#97E1F1;font-style:italic"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"info"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"> {"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"    #[account("}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children"